L-khatawat (b t-tartib)
1 . Qra kol l-7rouf li chbah flags. 3and ma-tl9a - wla 0 wla # wla + wla espace, 7fdha, w qdm sba3. Kmmel hta tl9a 7arf mkhtlf.
2 . Qra l-width. 3and ma-tl9a ar9am (1 ta 9), kon-hom f 3dd wa7ed. Kol rqm jdid ka-ydir “3dd 9dim × 10 + rqm jdid”. Ila kan l-3dd 4 w jak 2, ya3ni 4 × 10 + 2 = 42.
3 . Chouf wach jat nokta .. Ila jat, ya3ni kayn precision. Qra l-ar9am li ba3dha b nfs t-tari9a. Ila ma-kan-ch rqm ba3d l-nokta, precision = 0.
4 . Hada howa l-specifier (d, s, x...). Mn hna kat-3ref achno ghadi t-tb3.

